[00:21.70]God is love, and he invites us:
[00:26.52]‘Walk with me and love my way.’
[00:31.62]When we love both God and neighbor,
[00:36.86]Gracious deeds will fill each day.
[00:41.66]Therein lies the key to living;
[00:47.17]Therein lies the life we seek.
[00:53.60]Christlike love will never fail us;
[01:00.30]Christlike love through us will speak.
[01:14.12]Love of truth moves us to action;
[01:19.32]Love of God moves us to love.
[01:24.46]When we fail he seeks to help us;
[01:29.58]By his strength we rise above.
[01:34.82]Love is pure and never jealous;
[01:40.08]Love is kind and bears all things.
[01:45.44]May we grow to love our brother;
[01:52.78]May we taste what true love brings.
[02:04.78]Never let resentment lead you;
[02:12.06]May it never take your hand.
[02:17.36]Look to God, and he will guide you;
[02:22.42]He will teach you these commands:
[02:27.69]Love of God and love of neighbor,
[02:34.12]Ev’rything that love should be.
[02:39.36]May we always show to others
[02:47.32]Godlike love, yes, tenderly.
